{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09395","headline":"休暇东斋 · 韦应物","name":"休暇东斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由来束带士，请谒无朝暮。\n公暇及私身，何能独闲步。\n摘叶爱芳在，扪竹怜粉汚。\n岸帻偃东斋，夏天清晓露。\n怀仙阅真诰，贻友题幽素。\n荣达颇知疎，恬然自成度。\n绿苔日已满，幽寂谁来顾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}